{
  "slug": "cofounders",
  "name": "Cofounders",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AI co-founder toolkit — ROI calculator, market intel, GTM playbook, pitch prep, investor materials, and social marketing. Built for founders who think in numbers.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **8 skills** and **8 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (8): `cofounder` (Use when the user asks any business strategy question — ROI, pricing, market analysis, networking, pitch prep, or…), `cofounder-gtm-playbook` (Use when planning go-to-market strategy — networking, industry access, LinkedIn, conferences, content strategy, partnerships, outreach), `cofounder-market-intel` (Use when analyzing customer segments, market sizing, competitor analysis, or pricing strategy for ProduceGerX), `cofounder-pitch-prep` (Use when preparing for a client meeting, investor pitch, or demo), `cofounder-roi-calculator` (Use when calculating ROI, unit economics, CAC, LTV, break-even, runway, cash flow, or pricing scenarios for ProduceGerX), `cost-reducer` (Use when reviewing infrastructure costs, optimizing API spend, reducing cloud bills, or before adding new paid service integrations), `investor-agent` (Use when preparing pitch decks, investor materials, financial projections, fundraising strategy, market sizing, competitive analysis, or when the…), `social-marketing` (Use when planning social media content, writing posts, building content calendars, crafting ad copy, planning LinkedIn/Instagram/TikTok campaigns, growing…)\n- **Commands** (8): `cofounder-gtm` (Plan go-to-market strategy — networking, LinkedIn, conferences, content, and partnerships), `cofounder-market` (Analyze customer segments, market sizing, competitor analysis, and pricing strategy), `cofounder-pitch` (Prepare for meetings and pitches — client profiles, ROI arguments, objection handling, and scripts), `cofounder-roi` (Calculate ROI, unit economics, CAC, LTV, break-even, runway, or pricing scenarios), `cofounder` (Business strategy routing — ROI, pricing, market analysis, networking, pitch prep, or general business advice), `cost-reducer` (Review infrastructure costs, optimize API spend, and reduce cloud bills), `investor` (Prepare pitch decks, investor materials, financial projections, and fundraising strategy), `social-marketing` (Plan social media campaigns, write posts, build content calendars, and craft ad copy)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install cofounders@claude-community` from `asaferdman23/founder-toolkit`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
